ily share with readers.<!-- --> </p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 items-center"><div style="background-color:var(--color-mw-yellow);background-size:65% auto;background-image:url(/hp_assets/home/icon-highlight-interact.svg)" class="rounded-full bg-center bg-no-repeat w-[120px] h-[120px]"></div><div><p class="font-semibold text-lg">All-in-one</p><p>SaaS solution hosted in France with no deployment costs.<!-- --> </p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 items-center"><div style="background-color:var(--color-mw-teal-light);background-size:65% auto;background-image:url(/hp_assets/home/icon-highlight-integrated-content-solution2.svg)" class="rounded-full bg-center bg-no-repeat w-[120px] h-[120px]"></div><div><p class="font-semibold text-lg">Integrated content solution</p><p>Content monitoring, newsletter creation, content integration and distribution from a single platform.<!-- --> </p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 items-center"><div style="background-color:var(--color-mw-purple-light);background-size:65% auto;background-image:url(/hp_assets/home/icon-highlight-governance.svg)" class="rounded-full bg-center bg-no-repeat w-[120px] h-[120px]"></div><div><p class="font-semibold text-lg">Governance</p><p>Administration of user rights and roles.<!-- --> </p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 items-center"><div style="background-color:var(--color-mw-orange-light);background-size:65% auto;background-image:url(/hp_assets/home/icon-highlight-roi.svg)" class="rounded-full bg-center bg-no-repeat w-[120px] h-[120px]"></div><div><p class="font-semibold text-lg">ROI</p><p>Measure the performance of content and teams, newsletter campaigns, content hubs. Exportable statistics.<!-- --> </p></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 items-center"><div style="background-color:var(--color-mw-yellow-light);background-size:65% auto;background-image:url(/hp_assets/home/icon-highlight-brain.svg)" class="rounded-full bg-center bg-no-repeat w-[120px] h-